6	 * followed by detail lines (`- Entity id: 886`), the proposer's reason, and a
7	 * "[Review in Lobu](url)" link. The timeline card shows only the first block;
8	 * the detail belongs in the focused/peek view, not in a two-line clamp.
9	 */
10	
11	/** Trailing review CTA — its own affordance in the card, never summary prose. */
12	const REVIEW_LINK_LINE = /^\[Review in Lobu\]\(.*\)$/;
