					"**An agent** wants to merge [Duplicate Person](/acme/person/duplicate).\n" +
					"- Entity id: 886\n- Winner entity id: 315",
				href: "/acme/memory?run_ids=42",
				notification_id: 42,
				status: "action_approval_needed",
				unread: false,
			},
			{
				id: "run-43",
				kind: "run",
				at: "2026-07-27T12:01:00.000Z",
				title: "Failed run",
				body: "Run failed\n\n- raw provider detail",
				href: null,
				run_id: 43,
				status: "failed",
				unread: false,
			},
		],
		isLoading: false,
		isError: false,
	}),
}));
